/tank/dregg-build/nanodregg/main/decisions/gates.md:696:## GATES-20k · A failure of the tracer is not a verdict: UNREAD(tracer), re-run once, twice NOT JUDGED; a retry that passes is a counted flake (2026-10-21, ROOT ruling; GATES-10 verified at source)
